# The game server's image (Dockerfile) takes only what the server runs. Everything else stays out - the site, the
# GLBs, textures, Tripo files and photos, node_modules, the local store and logs, and any .env (secrets go in as Fly
# secrets, never in the image).
*
!app/package.json
!app/package-lock.json
!app/src/**
!app/server/**
!asset-generation/assets/cars/*/model.json
!asset-generation/assets/cars/*/meta.json
app/server/.env
app/server/.env.*
app/server/data/
app/server/logs/
**/.DS_Store
